s. Starting from 1,565,162 in 1952 and ending at 1,991,117 in 1961, the tobacco tax collections demonstrate a steady progression.\n\nI carefully sum each year's value, ensuring precision in the calculation. The process involves methodically adding each annual figure to build the cumulative total.\n\nAfter meticulously adding the tobacco tax amounts from 1952 to 1961, I arrive at a total of 17,122,803 thousand dollars.\n\nThe percentage difference calculation requires careful interpretation. I'll compute the relative difference between alcohol and tobacco tax revenues, focusing on the precise mathematical approach.\n\nThe key insight is the slight ambiguity in the calculation method. By taking the absolute difference of 12, -0.1, I recognize the need to clarify the exact percentage difference interpretation.\n\nTwo potential approaches emerge: one showing alcohol taxes are 41.43% higher than tobacco taxes, and another showing a 70.37% difference relative to tobacco. The calculation reveals nuanced perspectives on the revenue comparison.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_31c09161cfaf40c2b1ab4b44","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\n# Data from Treasury Bulletins - Alcohol and Tobacco tax revenue (in thousands of dollars)\n\n# From 1960 bulletin (page 77): 1952-1959\nalcohol = {\n    1952: 2549120,\n    1953: 2780925,\n    1954: 2797718,\n    1955: 2742840,\n    1956: 2920574,\n    1957: 2973195,\n    1958: 2946461,\n    1959: 3002096,\n}\n\ntobacco = {\n    1952: 1565162,\n    1953: 1654911,\n    1954: 1580512,\n    1955: 1571213,\n    1956: 1613497,\n    1957: 1674050,\n    1958: 1734021,\n    1959: 1806816,\n}\n\n# From 1961 bulletin (page 84): 1960\nalcohol[1960] = 3193714\ntobacco[1960] = 1931504\n\n# From 1962 bulletin (page 98): 1961\nalcohol[1961] = 3212801\ntobacco[1961] = 1991117\n\n# Calculate totals for fiscal years 1952-1961 (inclusive)\ntotal_alcohol = sum(alcohol.values())\ntotal_tobacco = sum(tobacco.values())\n\nprint(\"Alcohol tax revenue by year (in thousands):\")\nfor year in sorted(alcohol.keys()):\n    print(f\"  {year}: {alcohol[year]:,}\")\n\nprint(f\"\\nTotal Alcohol (1952-1961): {total_alcohol:,}\")\n\nprint(\"\\nTobacco tax revenue by year (in thousands):\")\nfor year in sorted(tobacco.keys()):\n    print(f\"  {year}: {tobacco[year]:,}\")\n\nprint(f\"\\nTotal Tobacco (1952-1961): {total_tobacco:,}\")\n\n# Calculate percentage difference\n# (Alcohol - Tobacco) / Tobacco * 100 = how much larger alcohol is than tobacco\ndifference = total_alcohol - total_tobacco\npercentage_diff = (difference / total_tobacco) * 100\n\nprint(f\"\\nDifference: {difference:,}\")\nprint(f\"Percentage difference (alcohol vs tobacco): {percentage_diff:.2f}%\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
